    "body": "<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n<a href=\"https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/developing-today/code/pull/8053?scope=ghh_OusAJGA4HG8ljoOV0wJvVx8NmnZIjc2DdjmxOu0xZWA&amp;cs_source=review_comment\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change.svg\" alt=\"Explain Change →\" height=\"32\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: rate limited by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> ## Review limit reached\n> \n> You've used all free OSS reviews for now. Wait for the free limit to reset to keep reviewing this public repository.\n> \n> **Next included review available in 20 minutes.**\n> \n> [Check out review usage here](https://app.coderabbit.ai/dashboard/review-capacity?orgId=f93703c8-bc6e-4f51-acb6-b9e750301211).\n> \n> <details>\n> <summary><strong>View limit details</strong></summary>\n> <dl>\n> <dd>\n> <br>\n> \n> **Limit details:** You’ve used the included review currently available.\n> \n> [Learn how review limits work](https://docs.coderabbit.ai/management/rate-limits).\n> \n> **Review configuration:**\n> \n> <details>\n> <summary><strong><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog-dark.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Run configuration</strong></summary>\n> <dl>\n> <dd>\n> <br>\n> \n> - **Source mode**: Auto\n> - **Repository**: Unavailable\n> - **Branch**: Unavailable\n> - **File**: No configuration file from this repository applied\n> - **Commit**: Unavailable\n> - **Layers**: defaults\n> - **Review profile**: CHILL\n> - **Plan**: Advanced\n> - **Run ID**: `23bacdf2-0ca0-466d-a8dc-cf73c554f0ce`\n> \n> </dd>\n> </dl>\n> </details>\n> \n> <details>\n> <summary><strong><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/git-commit-horizontal-dark.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/git-commit-horizontal.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Commits</strong></summary>\n> <dl>\n> <dd>\n> <br>\n> \n> Reviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between b409411253654d1954f058fe0c6540d3f8fb0507 and fafcc12754c4ff92629bfd21d5fd951097374bd7.\n> \n> </dd>\n> </dl>\n> </details>\n> \n> <details>\n> <summary><strong><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/file-plus-corner-dark.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/file-plus-corner.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Files selected for processing: 9</strong></summary>\n> <dl>\n> <dd>\n> <br>\n> \n> * `pm-stack/dispatch/README.md`\n> * `pm-stack/dispatch/install.sh`\n> * `pm-stack/dispatch/src/opencode.ts`\n> * `pm-stack/dispatch/src/queue.ts`\n> * `pm-stack/dispatch/src/server.ts`\n> * `pm-stack/dispatch/test/auth.test.ts`\n> * `pm-stack/dispatch/test/opencode.test.ts`\n> * `pm-stack/dispatch/test/queue.test.ts`\n> * `pm-stack/dispatch/test/server.test.ts`\n> \n> </dd>\n> </dl>\n> </details>\n> \n> </dd>\n> </dl>\n> </details>\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: rate limited by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Walkthrough</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\nThe dispatch server now exposes authenticated task and OpenCode session status reads, with identifier checks, normalized response fields, and lookup error handling. Tests cover the client, response projections, and route behavior. Documentation describes the endpoints and bearer-token storage and rotation locations.\n\n**Changes: Status read endpoints**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|:---|:---|\n|**Status reads, projections, and validation** <br> `pm-stack/dispatch/src/opencode.ts`, `pm-stack/dispatch/src/server.ts`, `pm-stack/dispatch/test/*`, `pm-stack/dispatch/README.md`|Adds authenticated task and session status routes. Responses expose selected fields, and the handlers validate identifiers and return lookup errors. Tests cover projections, authentication, and OpenCode client responses. The README documents endpoint responses and status codes.|\n|**Bearer-token vault documentation** <br> `pm-stack/dispatch/README.md`, `pm-stack/dispatch/install.sh`|Names the Bitwarden entry for the bearer token and documents rotation across Bitwarden and `~/secrets/dispatch.env`.|\n\n<!-- change_assessment_start -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n**Estimated code review effort:** 3 (Moderate) | ~20 minutes\n\n<!-- change_assessment_commit:\"b409411253654d1954f058fe0c6540d3f8fb0507\" -->\n<!-- change_assessment_priority:{\"version\":1,\"urgency\":\"p2\",\"manual\":false} -->\n**Change:** Feature\n<!-- change_assessment_end -->\n\n### Sequence Diagram(s)\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  actor Caller\n  participant DispatchServer\n  participant TaskQueue\n  participant OpenCodeClient\n  participant OpenCodeAPI\n  Caller->>DispatchServer: Authenticated task status GET\n  DispatchServer->>TaskQueue: Look up task ID\n  TaskQueue-->>DispatchServer: Task row\n  DispatchServer-->>Caller: Projected task status\n  Caller->>DispatchServer: Authenticated session status GET\n  DispatchServer->>OpenCodeClient: getSession(session ID)\n  OpenCodeClient->>OpenCodeAPI: Request session state\n  OpenCodeAPI-->>OpenCodeClient: Session response or error\n  OpenCodeClient-->>DispatchServer: Session data, null, or error\n  DispatchServer-->>Caller: Projected session status or error\n```\n\n**Possibly related issues**\n\n- developing-today/code issue 5555: The PR adds the task and session read endpoints and documents the token vault location described by this issue.\n- developing-today/code issue 4912: The PR adds per-ID session reads, but does not add the session judging logic described by this issue.\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Merge Risk:</strong> <strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/risk-normal-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Moderate</strong> · previous review <code>b4094</code></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<!-- final_review_risk_start -->\n<!-- final_review_risk_label\n**Merge Risk:** **🟡 Moderate** · up to `b4094`\n-->\n<!-- final_review_risk_coverage:{\"sourceCommitId\":\"b409411253654d1954f058fe0c6540d3f8fb0507\",\"coveredCommitId\":\"b409411253654d1954f058fe0c6540d3f8fb0507\",\"kind\":\"reviewed\"} -->\n\nResolve session repository restrictions before merging. Status reads also need accurate failure responses, and token rotation and recovery instructions should prevent stale credentials and avoidable authentication failures.\n<!-- final_review_risk_end -->\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Pre-merge checks: <sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-passed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Passed\" title=\"Passed\"></picture></sup> 4 · <sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merg